<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Littelfuse cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Littelfuse cut to neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it downgraded Littelfuse Inc to neutral from outperform.</p>
<p>-- The stock ended Tuesday at 44-3/8.</p>
